# Config & Secrets

- Never commit or paste `config.ini`, passwords, API keys, Node PSKs, or private logs/data. Runtime secrets stay local; env overrides include `HESSENBOT_WEB_PASSWORD` and `HESSENBOT_WEB_SECRET`.
- New or changed options: add the key (with comment) in `config.template` first, then read it in `modules/settings.py`; for web-admin fields, add a tooltip in `modules/admin_config_tooltips.py`.
- Do not rename existing config keys or sections without a migration path (`update.sh` / config merge).
- Keep config UTF-8. Choose defaults that do not silently flip Meshhessen behaviour (e.g. `ignoreDefaultChannel`).
